  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After eight doors labyrinth is dismantled, Yu Lu blessed land shows as a broad space without sky or ground, with no living beings and none of the resources Gu Immortals usually accumulate.",
      "chapters": [
        917
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tai Bai Yun Sheng tells Fang Yuan that the secret blessed land Shark Demon wants repaired is Yu Lu blessed land, not Shark Demon’s own land. Fairy Yu Lu was the second disciple of Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable. The entrance had already been destroyed, so Shark Demon needs Landscape as Before to restore it, and Tai Bai Yun Sheng uses that need to gain trust and a chance to explore.",
      "chapters": [
        683
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_shark_demon",
        "char_fairy_yu_lu",
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "move_landscape_as_before"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later Fang Yuan notes that Tai Bai Yun Sheng is with Shark Demon, entering the sea and exploring the land.",
      "chapters": [
        713
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and Tai Bai Yun Sheng later pass Yu Lu blessed land’s entrance in Eastern Sea, led by scenic blue travel immortal zombie Sha Nan Jiang.",
      "chapters": [
        981
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After eight doors labyrinth is dismantled, the land shows as a broad space without sky or ground, with no living beings and none of the resources Gu Immortals usually accumulate. Fang Yuan has already met three battlefield killer moves inside it: freezing rain frozen earth, fighting soul battlefield, and eight doors labyrinth. Su Bai Man says Fairy Yu Lu was a disciple of Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable, and treats that lineage as why the aperture can hold such moves. Immortal Gu are present even without a resource stockpile, because the battlefield killer moves need them.",
      "chapters": [
        917
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "interior-form",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_su_bai_man",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
